OL,3,AThey were labelled 'pervert glasses'.
OL,4,AWill a camera-free version transform
OL,5,Atheir image?
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey were labelled 'pervert glasses'.
OL,8,FWill a camera-free version transform
OL,9,Ftheir image?
OL,11,FWhen Meta first launched its AI-powered
OL,12,Fsmart glasses in 2023, in collaboration
OL,13,Fwith the trendy sunglasses brand
OL,14,FRay-Ban, it unleashed a storm of
OL,15,Fcontroversy.
OL,17,FThere have been multiple reports of the
OL,18,Fdevices being used to harass women and
OL,19,Fgirls in particular, filming them
OL,20,Fwithout their consent, then sharing the
OL,21,Ffootage.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,109,105,200,300,0,100
