OL,1,W5j 5Qw;j 5wsjj#5wsjs1ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AThey were labelled 'pervert glasses'.
OL,4,AWill a camera-free version transform
OL,5,Atheir image?
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe image problem doesn't seem to have
OL,8,Fbeen cured by Meta's enlistment this
OL,9,Fsummer of Kylie Jenner, Kim
OL,10,FKardashian's sister, as their prime
OL,11,Fmodel. The devices have been dubbed
OL,12,F"pervert" or "creepy" glasses. In the
OL,13,FUK, JD Wetherspoon pubs, a handful of
OL,14,Fmajor theatres, Comic-Con, some
OL,15,Fschools, and Faslane, home of the UK's
OL,16,Fnuclear submarines, have all chosen to
OL,17,Fban them.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
